🎬 The set is ready. Now, we’re waiting for you!

Our Fall 26–27 recruitment booth is complete! From the first design to the final cutout, a big shoutout to our Booth Decoration Team for bringing it all together. Every hand-cut letter, carefully placed detail, and helping hand deserves credit. 
