Thank you for putting your creativity, time, and effort into giving AFC such a beautiful booth!✨ 

Now it’s your turn to be part of the picture. Visit our booth from October 11–15, meet the team, and register to join AIUB Film Club. Whether you love acting, filmmaking, script writing, music, or are simply curious to explore—come say hello!

Online registration link:-
